{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:44 2026-06-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:44 2026-06-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:44 2026-06-12 HKT</p><p>將軍澳工業邨駿才街77號TVB電視廣播城，今（12日）中午12時40分，警方及消防接報指「古裝街」片場位置發生火警。消防接報到場，列為二級火警，動用 4條喉及3隊煙帽隊撲救，約中午1時04分將火救熄，其間毋須疏散，暫未有受傷報告。消防正調查起火原因。</p><img alt=\"古裝街片場起火。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f12e170931f5e9131e4ce2f6afb16e06/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_13_58_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防開喉射水撲救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3f8477ec36418b05fac1a1cfffa1cdc/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_13_58_40.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯救火。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/279ed42fd445aeb913e54bd07c72c0ab/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_13_58_39_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a98a4ebafd32445efb0a67734ba9475/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_13_58_39.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a56602549a622e43d35c785f65583335/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_13_58_38_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/748af74a524e3d61f24d1eb6ef8d6559/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_13_58_38_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場。曾海帆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37cf13988448a0b411ee226c59dd4fa7/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_13_50_53.jpeg\"/><p>從網上流傳的影片可見，片場中的搭建物有兩層高，兩層的窗戶均噴出烈焰，火勢猛烈，不斷冒出濃煙，消防要升起雲梯救火射水。搭建物外牆嚴重熏黑。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-12T07:01:59.491481+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}